ts, calculate $A+B.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/state.json" "file_sha256" "18d08804db0ec8a366cc0642707cede73e72624145564da97a3440a6b9351b3f" "basis" 1140 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10972" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Our task is to find $A$ and $B$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{6x-25}{x(x+5)}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{(x+5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $x(x+5)$ gives\n\n$$\n6x-25=A(x+5)+B(x).\n$$\n\nFor $x=0$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6(0)-25 & =A(0+5)+B(0) \\\\ -25 & =5A \\\\ A & =-\\frac{25}{5} \\\\ A & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-5$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6(-5)-25 & =A(-5+5)+B(-5) \\\\ -55 & =-5B \\\\ B & =\\frac{-55}{-5} \\\\ B & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA+B=-5+11=6.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/state.json" "file_sha256" "18d08804db0ec8a366cc0642707cede73e72624145564da97a3440a6b9351b3f" "basis" 1140 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10972" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9b32a3d6ebef79dd0ca7711e1ea66dbf1bb79bf3c2ffae90460b81de65d21987" "basis" 1140 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008799/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10972" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacad